WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
How many people does antimicrobial resistance kill?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
The study modelled AMR deaths in 204 countries and territories.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
4.95 million deaths were associated with bacterial resistance in 2019.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
1.27 million deaths were directly attributable to resistance.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Highest burden: western sub-Saharan Africa, 27.3 per 100 000. Lowest: Australasia, 6.5.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Six pathogens caused 73.4% of attributable deaths.

7
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.500
AMR is a leading cause of death worldwide. The Lancet, 2022. Scroll for the full breakdown.
